The defining polynomial becomes
$$r^2(r^2-2r\cos\theta-\sin^2\theta),$$
so the region is the cardioid
$$0\le r\le1+\cos\theta,qquad-\pi\le\theta\le\pi.$$

See also: <Green theorem>, <Cardioid>.

