$$\int_{r=R}x_ix_j\,dS=\delta_{ij}\frac{R^2A_{n-1}(R)}n
=\delta_{ij}\frac{\pi^{n/2}R^{n+1}}{\Gamma(n/2+1)}.$$

See also: <Spherical symmetry>, <Isotropic tensor integral>.

