The graph has six edges, and $A$ has degree one. Hence $\pi_A=1/12$. Kac's return-time formula gives
$$\mathbb E_A T_A^+=\frac1{\pi_A}=12.$$

See also: <Kac lemma>, <Stationary distribution of a graph random walk>.

