$$\langle\psi|Z\otimes Z|\psi\rangle=1-2p_{ZZ},qquad
\langle\psi|X\otimes I|\psi\rangle=1-2p_{XI}.$$
The identity in part (b) implements each controlled tensor product by gates on its two target wires with the common control. By linearity,
$$\langle\psi|W|\psi\rangle=2-2(p_{ZZ}+p_{XI}).$$

See also: <Hadamard test>, <Pauli matrix>, <Measurement of a Pauli observable>.

