The endpoint duals are
$$ (\ell^1)^*\cong\ell^\infty,\qquad (c_0)^*\cong\ell^1,$$
under the same coordinate pairing $\langle x,y\rangle=\sum_nx_ny_n$.

See also: <Duality of sequence spaces>, <Space of sequences converging to zero>.

